Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:26:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): explain viewport toolbar buttons on hover

Add names and action descriptions for all twelve toolbar buttons.
Pin rendered hover text and preserve hover suppression during drags.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2776
